  "title": "早上好、下午好、晚上好、晚安",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "情境导入",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "丹尼的一天" },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "早上、下午、晚上，见面怎么打招呼？" },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "kind": "cards",
          "items": [
            { "id": "c1a", "text": "Hello!", "color": "blue" },
            { "id": "c1b", "text": "Goodbye!", "color": "orange" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "小朋友们好！欢迎来到二年级的英语课！" },
        { "say": "还记得一年级学过的打招呼吗？见面说——" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "Hello! Hello!", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "分别的时候说——" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "Goodbye! Goodbye!", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "今天我们跟着丹尼过一天，学一学早上、下午、晚上见面该怎么说。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "新单词：morning 和 afternoon",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "太阳升起来，太阳在头顶" },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "kind": "cards",
          "items": [
            { "id": "c1a", "text": "morning 早上", "color": "orange" },
            { "id": "c1b", "text": "afternoon 下午", "color": "blue" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "afternoon：重音在后面 noon" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "太阳公公刚刚升起来，丹尼背着书包去上学。这是早上。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "早上，英语这样说，跟我读。" },
        { "say": "morning, morning", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "再读一遍，嘴巴张圆一点。" },
        { "say": "morning", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "吃过午饭，太阳从头顶慢慢往西走，这是下午。" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "下午，英语这样说，跟我读。" },
        { "say": "afternoon, afternoon", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "这个词后半截要读得又重又长，像火车鸣笛一样。再来一遍。" },
        { "say": "afternoon", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "新单词：evening 和 night",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "太阳落山了，月亮出来了" },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "kind": "cards",
          "items": [
            { "id": "c1a", "text": "evening 晚上", "color": "purple" },
            { "id": "c1b", "text": "night 夜晚", "color": "gray" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "evening 只有两拍：eve-ning" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "太阳落山了，天慢慢黑下来，一家人吃晚饭，这是晚上。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "晚上，跟我读。" },
        { "say": "evening, evening", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "这个词只有两拍，拍拍手一起读。" },
        { "say": "evening", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "月亮和星星都出来了，小朋友要上床睡觉了，这是夜晚。" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "夜晚，跟我读。" },
        { "say": "night, night", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "很好！四个新单词都认识啦。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "四句问候语",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "见面问候怎么说" },
        {
          "id": "g1",
          "kind": "table",
          "rows": [
            ["什么时候", "说什么"],
            ["早上", "Good morning."],
            ["下午", "Good afternoon."],
            ["晚上见面", "Good evening."],
            ["睡觉前", "Good night."]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "在单词前面加上一个“好”字，就变成了问候语。跟我读。" },
        { "spotlight": "g1" },
        { "say": "Good morning. Good morning.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "这是早上好。下一句，下午好。" },
        { "say": "Good afternoon. Good afternoon.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "晚上见面说晚上好。" },
        { "say": "Good evening. Good evening.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "睡觉前说晚安。" },
        { "say": "Good night. Good night.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "真棒！四句问候语，一天都能用得上。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "晚上好还是晚安",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "晚上好 ≠ 晚安" },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "kind": "cards",
          "items": [
            { "id": "c1a", "text": "晚上见面：Good evening.", "color": "purple" },
            { "id": "c1b", "text": "睡前道别：Good night.", "color": "gray" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "晚上见到邻居，不说“晚安”哦！" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "晚上在深圳湾公园散步，碰到了邻居阿姨，我们该说什么呢？" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "见面打招呼，要说晚上好。" },
        { "say": "Good evening!", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "那晚安什么时候说呢？是睡觉前，或者晚上要分开回家的时候。" },
        { "say": "Good night!", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "记住：晚上见面说晚上好，睡前道别才说晚安。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "情景对话",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "丹尼的一天" },
        {
          "id": "g1",
          "kind": "table",
          "rows": [
            ["Kitty:", "Good morning, Danny."],
            ["Danny:", "Good morning, Kitty."],
            ["Danny:", "Good afternoon, Miss Fang."],
            ["Miss Fang:", "Good afternoon, Danny."],
            ["Kitty:", "Good night, Danny."]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "早上，丹尼在校门口遇到了好朋友基蒂。听一听，再跟我读。" },
        { "spotlight": "g1" },
        { "say": "Good morning, Danny.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "丹尼回答。" },
        { "say": "Good morning, Kitty.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "下午，丹尼在走廊遇到方老师。" },
        { "say": "Good afternoon, Miss Fang.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "方老师笑着回答。" },
        { "say": "Good afternoon, Danny.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "晚上，两个好朋友一起散步，要回家了，基蒂说——" },
        { "say": "Good night, Danny.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "你能替丹尼回答吗？对，把名字换一换就行。" },
        { "say": "Good night, Kitty.", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "书写小提示",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "书写小提示" },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "Good morning, Danny." },
        {
          "id": "l1",
          "kind": "bullets",
          "items": ["句子开头字母要大写", "人名开头字母要大写", "句子末尾加句号"]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "看这句话，我们一起读。" },
        { "say": "Good morning, Danny.", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "l1" },
        { "say": "句子开头的第一个字母要大写，所以这个“好”字的第一个字母是大写的。" },
        { "say": "丹尼是人名，人名的第一个字母也要大写。" },
        { "say": "句子写完了，末尾加上一个小圆点，这就是英文的句号。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "学法口诀",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "看太阳，选问候" },
        {
          "id": "l1",
          "kind": "bullets",
          "items": ["太阳升起早上好", "太阳偏西下午好", "太阳落山晚上好", "上床睡觉说晚安"]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "我们来学一个小口诀，老师读一句，你跟一句。" },
        { "spotlight": "l1" },
        { "say": "太阳升起早上好——" },
        { "say": "Good morning!", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "太阳偏西下午好——" },
        { "say": "Good afternoon!", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "太阳落山晚上好——" },
        { "say": "Good evening!", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "上床睡觉说晚安——" },
        { "say": "Good night!", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "看一看太阳在哪里，就知道该说哪一句啦。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "小结",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "今天学会了" },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "kind": "cards",
          "items": [
            { "id": "c1a", "text": "morning", "color": "orange" },
            { "id": "c1b", "text": "afternoon", "color": "blue" },
            { "id": "c1c", "text": "evening", "color": "purple" },
            { "id": "c1d", "text": "night", "color": "gray" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "前面加上 Good，就是问候语。" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "一句话小结：一天中的不同时间，要用不同的问候语。我们再把四个词读一遍。" },
        { "say": "morning, afternoon, evening, night", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "明天早上到学校，记得先和老师说一声早上好哦！" }
      ]
    },
